sparring-weapons = Weapons:

sparring-contract-tip = The Chaplain's Deity wishes for honorable fighting. As such, it uses contracts. Signing your name will set the terms for the battle. Then, the person you intend to spar with must sign the other side. If terms are changed on an already signed contract, the signatures will erase and the new terms must be re-agreed upon.

