sparring-weapon-1 = Fist Fight

sparring-weapon-2 = Ceremonial Weapons

sparring-weapon-3 = Melee Only

sparring-weapon-4 = Any Weapons

sparring-weapon-1-desc = You will fight with your fists only. Any weapons will be considered a violation.

sparring-weapon-2-desc = You can only fight with ceremonial weapons. You will be at a severe disadvantage without one!

sparring-weapon-3-desc = You can fight with weapons, or fists if you have none. Ranged weapons are a violation.

sparring-weapon-4-desc = You can fight with any and all weapons as you please. Try not to kill them, okay?

sparring-arena = Arena:

sparring-arena-desc = This fight will take place in the { $area }. Leaving the arena mid-fight is a violation.

sparring-stakes = Stakes:

sparring-stakes-1 = No Stakes

sparring-stakes-2 = Holy Match

sparring-stakes-3 = Money Match

sparring-stakes-4 = Your Soul

sparring-stakes-1-desc = No stakes, just for fun. Who doesn't love some recreational sparring?

sparring-stakes-2-desc = A match for the chaplain's deity. The Chaplain suffers large consequences for failure, but advances their sect by winning.

sparring-stakes-3-desc = A match with money on the line. Whomever wins takes all the money of whomever loses.

sparring-stakes-4-desc = A lethal match with the loser's soul becoming under ownership of the winner.

